# Important! Commas cannot come after the last json entry

### Register a user
POST http://localhost:1322/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "arpie",
  "password": "password"
}

### Log in a user
POST http://localhost:1322/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "arpie",
  "password": "password"
}

### Log in using invalid credentials
POST http://localhost:1322/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "arpie",
  "password": "wrongPassword!"
}

